                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 3]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Form Suggested for Record of Marriages; to be Filed with
                        The Adjutant General</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Be it remembered that on this the _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ day of _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _
                    _ _ _, (Month) 191_ _ _, at _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _, (City) _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _
                    _ _ _, (Country) _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _, (Rank) _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _
                    _ _ _, (Name) _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _, _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _, (No.) _ _ _
                    _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _, (Organization) was lawfully married to _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _
                    _ _ _ _ _ In testimony whereof this certificate is now signed this _ _ _ _ _ _ _
                    _ _ _ _ _ day of _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ 191_ _ _, by the aforesaid _ _ _ _ _
                    _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ and by the person solemnizing the marriage, namely, _ _ _
                    _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _, the <hi rendition="#italic">maire of
                        arrondissement</hi> _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _
                    _(Address)</p>
                <p rendition="#right">(Signed) _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ <lb/>
                    (Contracting Party</p>
                <p rendition="#right">_ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ <lb/> (Officiating
                    Party)</p>
            </div>
